    ["……刚才的状态很奇怪，也许它的精神影响还没散去。我必须再次向你的提醒表示感谢。"] = "…The state just now was very strange; perhaps its mental influence hasn't dissipated yet. I must thank you again for your reminder.",
    ["　　据警察部门透露，韦尔奇先生家里惨不忍睹，还丢失了所有的财物。有理由相信，这是一伙残忍凶恶的歹徒，他们会毫不犹豫杀掉无辜的目击者，比如韦尔奇先生，比如娜娅女士。\n　　这是对王国法律的践踏！这是对公众安全的挑衅！好消息是，警察部门已经锁定了凶手、抓到了主犯。我们将尽快给出后续报道。"] = "According to the police department, the scene at Mr. Welch's home was horrific, and all his property was stolen. There is reason to believe that this is a group of cruel and vicious criminals who would not hesitate to kill innocent witnesses, such as Mr. Welch and Ms. Naya. \n This is a trampling of the kingdom's laws! This is a provocation to public safety! The good news is that the police department has identified the culprits and captured the main perpetrator. We will provide follow-up reports as soon as possible.",
