    ["伦纳德（交谈后）"] = "Leonard (After Conversation)",
    ["伯德温·威瑟尔以非凡者身份征战背誓之战，载誉而归。临终前，他将自己的非凡特性融入铠甲，赋予它“坚强不屈的灵魂”，为它取名伊桑。此后六百年，伊桑守护着威瑟尔家族，只需一句古赫密斯语便能拔剑出鞘。直到庄园遇袭之夜，它被未知污染侵蚀，机械地执行命令，屠尽了庄园内每一个活人。\n“为了家族的荣耀！”"] = "Baldwin Wetherell fought in the War of Broken Oaths as a Beyonder and returned with honors. Before his death, he fused his Beyonder characteristic into his armor, endowing it with a 'strong and unyielding soul,' and named it Ethan. For the next six hundred years, Ethan guarded the Wetherell family, requiring only a single phrase in ancient Hermes to draw its sword. Until the night the manor was attacked, it was eroded by unknown corruption, mechanically executing orders and slaughtering every living person in the manor. \n \"For the glory of the family!\"",
